{"_schema":"rp-faction-volume-v1","world":"danmachi","faction_id":"hestia-familia","volume":"vol-21","periods":[{"period_id":"vol-21-hestia-familia-victimized-and-rallies","volume":"vol-21","time":"全卷","name":{"zh":"赫斯缇雅眷族","en":"Hestia Familia","jp":"ヘスティア・ファミリア"},"type":"familia","leader":"hestia","base":"灶火馆","summary":"赫斯缇雅眷族在本卷成为芙蕾雅侵略的主要受害者。贝尔被奥它掳走，莉莉、韦尔夫、命、春姬遭贾里巴四兄弟和艾伦重创，并被魅惑篡改成不记得贝尔。赫斯缇雅独自保留真实记忆却被迫装作陌生人，以保护眷族性命。圣火解除魅惑后，所有成员因伤害贝尔而崩溃或自责，但迅速重整并奔赴战场原野迎回贝尔。","status":{"public_view":"魅惑解除后被视为正当受害者与反芙蕾雅阵营核心","combat_power":"小规模眷族，但拥有贝尔、韦尔夫魔剑、春姬等级提升等关键战术资源"},"key_members":["hestia","bell-cranel","liliruca-arde","welf-crozzo","mikoto-yamato","sanjouno-haruhime"],"key_events":["freya-abducts-bell-and-charms-orario","hestia-resists-charm-but-must-reject-bell","hestia-sacred-flame-breaks-freya-charm","hestia-and-freya-declare-war-game"],"evidence_level":"S","source_refs":["danmachi-main/vol-21/chapters/ch-002-第一章-于是「侵略」开始.txt","danmachi-main/vol-21/chapters/ch-003-第二章-封闭世界的孤独.txt","danmachi-main/vol-21/chapters/ch-006-第五章-在她的世界末日里.txt"]}],"source_refs":["danmachi-main/vol-21/chapters"]}